{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901034140010","name":"甘奈","text":"『もしもーし、私メリーさん☆\r\n今、事務所の前にいるよ～』","trans":"“喂——，我是玛丽☆\n现在在事务所门前哦～”","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（はは、甘奈のいたずらか）","trans":"（哈哈，是甘奈的恶作剧啊）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901034140020","name":"甘奈","text":"私メリーさん☆\r\n今、あなたの後ろに――","trans":"我是玛丽☆\n现在，就在你后面——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901034140030","name":"甘奈","text":"――わっ！","trans":"——哇！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-14","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あ、甘奈！\r\n大丈夫か……！","trans":"啊，甘奈！\n没事吧……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901034140040","name":"甘奈","text":"う、うん……！\r\n平気……！","trans":"嗯、嗯……！\n没事……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そうか……！\r\nそれならよかったよ……","trans":"这样啊……！\n那就好……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……。甘奈、もしよかったら\r\nもう一回やってもいいぞ？　ケガはないみたいだし","trans":"……。甘奈，要是可以的话\n再来一次也行哦？　看起来没受伤","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901034140060","name":"甘奈","text":"……！\r\nうん！　じゃあドアの外からね！","trans":"……！\n嗯！　那我在门外哦！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}